        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "title",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "# NorthPeak Goods \u2014 CTR Optimization: Spend & Drift\n",
                "\n",
                "**What happened:** three weeks ago marketing shifted budget from Search to **Social + Display** (impression share jumped from ~20% to ~50%). Those prospecting/awareness segments reach colder audiences, so their true CTR collapsed \u2014 but the **stale production model** kept predicting the old ~2.4% rate, so the bidding system over-bid and burned **~$242K**.\n",
                "\n",
                "**On this page:** the top line shows the stale model's prediction (orange) staying flat while actual CTR (navy) falls \u2014 that widening gap is the wasted spend. The area chart shows the Social/Display mix swelling; the bars show where CTR collapsed and where the waste concentrated."
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 12,
            "height": 3
          }
